    "detailed_description": "Human beings have uncontrolled destruction of the earth' resources, Aliens had sent Angle - Undo Zai to implement the fifth extinction of the earth. This is the final test for humanity.<br><br><strong>Defend Our World</strong><br>4 player need to work together to protect our world from invasion of UNDO Zai. With 4 different ability characters and skills, player can play as a team to help each other challenge the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Small Indie Game </h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Single player shooting and challenge the normal or survival game mode. <br></li><li>Multiplayer - 2 to 4 Player team PC shooting game, high definition furry anime characters in a non-stop action shooter.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569720/extras/AOUZ_03.gif?t=1638279076\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fantasy 3D character art and animation in a non-stop action shooting and dodge attack.<br></li><li>Single or team with 4 Player for the game challenge with 4 different title map.<br></li><li>Normal battle mode and survival battle mode for challenge</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Steam Matchmaking and Lobbies</h2>Steam's peer to peer matchmaking API is built around to concept of a lobby can have up to 250 users in it and set of functions that enable users to find other users to play a game with. More information can visit <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569720/extras/045c9996a913671bc1e31e03cd77ac03.poster.avif?t=1638279076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569720/extras/045c9996a913671bc1e31e03cd77ac03.webm?t=1638279076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1